OL,3,AWhat is PHP and why did it spark a
OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security scramble?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a decade, serious flaws
OL,7,Fhad gone undetected in the technology
OL,8,Funderpinning much of the internet.
OL,10,FIt took AI to bring them to light and
OL,11,Fcaused a global cyber-security alert.
OL,13,FThe vulnerabilities lie within a
OL,14,Fprogramming language called PHP, which
OL,15,Fhas been used internationally since the
OL,16,F2000s to build websites.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
